We need to produce full file contents for site/index.html, site/app.js, and MEMORY.md. Ensure we include all lines, not just modifications. We must replace the entire file content, so we need to copy the existing file content and add the new element.

First, site/index.html: Let's locate the relevant part. In the provided index.html snippet, there is a section with class "stats". It includes:

<div class="stat">
  <span>Last Update</span>
  <strong id="last-update">--</strong>
</div>

We need to add a span id="last-update-relative" after that, maybe with class for styling? The existing CSS includes .stat span etc. For relative time, we need a span element that will be filled by JS. In the existing "Last Wake" stat, there is:

<div class="stat">
  <span>Last Wake</span>
  <strong id="last-wake">--</strong>
  <span id="last-wake-relative" style="font-size:0.75rem;color:#8b949e;display:block;margin-top:0.25rem;"></span>
</div>

So we should add similar for Last Update:

<div class="stat">
